			"Message": "fix(configuration): Add missing getValue method implementation\n\nThis commit completes the ConfigurationService implementation by adding the missing getValue method that was omitted during the recent refactor (29bf5b1). The method provides the core functionality for retrieving configuration values by key and scope, which is essential for the service's intended purpose.\n\nThe implementation follows the established pattern from the refactor, checking for scope configuration existence and returning the appropriate value or default. This ensures the ConfigurationService can now properly serve configuration data to other components in the Cocoon system.",
			"SHA": "ba2d93b7a8c9ffa301874256105f108305030f35"
