			"Message": "refactor(configuration): Use instance methods for nested value operations\n\nThis refactor moves the nested value access logic into the ConfigurationService class as instance methods, enhancing encapsulation and aligning with object-oriented design principles. The changes ensure that configuration data manipulation is handled internally within the service.",
